Subject: RE: Nordline rate renewal 2027 - ocean lanes

Benchmark is done. The market is moving +2 to +4% for 2027 on comparable Euro=
pe - Asia and Europe - US East Coast lanes, so +6% is clearly above market. O=
verview of what I found:

Only the Q3 index average gets close to the top of that range. Gdansk - Shang=
hai is the one lane where a higher increase is plausible because of the trans=
hipment, but even there I would not go beyond +4%.

Proposal: we counter at +3% across the board and offer a committed volume in =
return.

Source | Increase 2027 vs 2026
Forwarder B quote (Europe - Asia) | +2.0%
Carrier C direct quote (Europe - USEC) | +3.5%
Spot/contract index, Q3 average | +4.0%
Nordline offer | +6.0%

Best regards,
