Mark, Elena, Nordline's 2027 offer is in: +6% flat on all 19 lanes, valid unt=
il 30 Nov. They want our answer by 18 Nov. No differentiation per lane at all=
, which looks like a standard uplift rather than a calculated one.

I will benchmark against what we see from other forwarders and the index data=
 before we react. Should have it by the end of next week. Elena, can you pull=
 the 2026 TEU actuals per lane from the contract report so we know what volum=
e we can put on the table?

